# Competency question (Stage 2): the mode/experience cut holds over the whole
# ontology. The occurrent felt episode (gmeow:AffectiveExperience) sits on the
# mental-PROCESS spine (⊑ gmeow:MentalProcess) and is NEVER in the endurant
# gmeow:MentalMoment family — modes are endurants (logic:Mode), experiences are
# occurrents (logic:Event), and the foundation's logic:Endurant/logic:Perdurant
# disjointness keeps them apart. Asserted lane; runs over the merged ontology
# (the Experience ⊑ MentalProcess edge lives in the mentation slice).

PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>

ASK {
    gmeow:AffectiveExperience rdfs:subClassOf* gmeow:MentalProcess .
    FILTER NOT EXISTS { gmeow:AffectiveExperience rdfs:subClassOf* gmeow:MentalMoment . }
}
